        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk2-verb-repeat-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Make an action brief or tentative",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "For an eligible verb, AA, A一A and ABAB can present a brief or tentative action. A了A presents a brief completed action. These forms do not mean doing the whole event again on a later occasion; a two-syllable verb repeats as a whole.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "你看看。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ kàn kàn 。",
                "meaning": "Take a look.",
                "audio": "b7a6bf1d4966f039255174778d7c643183cde5a9bfdcbbdf76c186563e1a67ff"
              },
              {
                "text": "你看一看。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ kàn yī kàn 。",
                "meaning": "Have a quick look.",
                "audio": "3b1a0a236200247f5f7547037f4c7d9c920235db33bb186eefed5cf7632f39f4"
              },
              {
                "text": "他看了看这本书。",
                "pinyin": "tā kàn le kàn zhè běn shū 。",
                "meaning": "He took a quick look at this book.",
                "audio": "32c157f0f7f8833680d9c9b5f30e21c5a30d099a25f4e11f88e9048a21860618"
